**Conflict resolution map**
- `src/cljc/yin/repl/frontends.cljc`: the antlr binding is installed on every host and carries master's `:render python.antlr.repl/display-value`. I dropped our `:display :output`, because master's engine no longer reads `:display`, and I updated the docstring to match.
- `test/yin/repl/python_antlr_test.cljc`: only the require block conflicted. I kept `yang.antlr.packet` and took master's `at` in the `c3-programs` refer. The rest merged automatically, so the per-host harness and master's acceptance rows are both present.
